  (polyline (pts (xy 248.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 220.00)) (stroke (width 0.3) (type default)) (uuid "d4531c1a-55e4-5a58-b2b3-9b5404738d19"))
  (text "(1) VC-SCH-5000 revision 0C. Wires are drawn on the circuit sheets.\n(2) A global label is a wire that continues on another sheet.\n(3) OPEN means the order code is not chosen. TBC means the pin is not confirmed.\n(4) Product text is the maker and the short type, then the Ground UP article.\n(5) Numbered notes sit in this band. A marker such as (1) is the only note in the circuit.\n(6) The notes sheet lists the nets that leave a sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 249.60 221.40 0)
